# Crash artifacts. A panicking test can drop an ELF core dump next to the
# crate it ran in. `coco-rs/core/` is a real source layer, so the bare `core`
# pattern must be negated for it — keep that negation if you touch this block.
core
!coco-rs/core/
core.[0-9]*
vgcore.*
*.stackdump
